Hi, I'm Garrett. Welcome to my blog/space for rambling about random shit.

I'm a software engineer, avid runner, and sometimes I write. I'm a child of the desert and
mountains living in the flattest, rainiest country on earth.

>[]($block.attrs("author-note"))
> You'll see these all across my blog. They're just meta-comments from me about what other
> me is writing. For example, current me is struggling to write this introduction without
> coming off either too self-deprecating or like too much of an asshole.

If you'd like to read things I write, check out the creatively-named
[Blog]($link.page('blog')). I keep a running list of things I've enjoyed
reading/watching/playing/listening over on the [Shelf]($link.page('shelf')), and if you'd
like to know more about me as a person you can check out the [About]($link.page('about'))
page.

This site is built with [zine](https://zine-ssg.io/), a fantastic lightweight SSG that gets
simplicity right. Highly recommend.
